00:03:05.760 --> 00:03:08.310
But this is a felony in North Carolina.

00:03:08.310 --> 00:03:13.739
And in an interview last year, Kim, who who's
the secretary of state in Washington State,

00:03:13.739 --> 00:03:19.200
where they've been doing vote by mail for
years, she said that these double voting scenarios

00:03:19.200 --> 00:03:20.749
