00:03:20.749 --> 00:03:24.330
She said, quote, We can usually run our list
of people who have appeared to vote more than

00:03:24.330 --> 00:03:28.040
once out of three point five million ballots
in 2018.

00:03:28.040 --> 00:03:31.180
It appears one hundred people may have voted
