00:03:39.420 --> 00:03:42.879
This is the number of people who tried to
vote more than once.

00:03:42.879 --> 00:03:44.279
And Kim Whyman added.

00:03:44.279 --> 00:03:45.359
Is it perfect?

00:03:45.359 --> 00:03:46.359
No.

00:03:46.359 --> 00:03:47.829
